    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29042" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mileum</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Milevum</span></b> ), i, n., and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mi-levi</span></b> ,
		ōrum, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city in Numidia</i>, <i><span class="en">Aug. adv. Don. 6, 20</span></i>.—Hence,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Milēvetānus</span></b> , a, um, <i>adj., of</i> or <i>belonging to the
				city of Mileum</i>, <i><span class="en">Aug. Ep. 34</span></i>.</div>
